      "updated": 1778065373009,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Click on a card will marked as completed and move to another stage \n2. Click on a single product will strike through product, marked as prepared \n3. Ticket number same as Order number \n4. Open fix URL \"localhost:0000/KDS\"",
